@startuml
|Secretary|
start
:Register student;
:Record intake;
:Add guardians;

if (Enrollment by Secretary?) then (Yes)
  :Enroll in any program;
else (No)
  |Coordinator|
  :Enroll in their program;
endif

|Coordinator|
:Track academics & attendance;

if (Transition needed?) then (Yes)
  :Request program change;
elseif (Drop/Complete?) then (Yes)
  :Request status change;
else
  stop
endif

|Director|
:Approve or reject;
stop
@enduml